{"nodes": [{"id": "_context_features_time_blocks_feature", "label": "Feature: Hor\u00e1rio bloqueado (TimeBlock)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".context/features/time-blocks.md", "source_location": "topo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reserva um per\u00edodo sem paciente (almo\u00e7o, reuni\u00e3o, f\u00e9rias). D\u00e9bitos aceitos: M\u00eas n\u00e3o renderiza bloqueios (s\u00f3 o aviso funciona l\u00e1) e o aviso s\u00f3 cobre a janela carregada da agenda."}, {"id": "_context_features_time_blocks_separate_table_firewall", "label": "TimeBlock em tabela separada (firewall do scheduler)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/time-blocks.md", "source_location": "Decis\u00e3o que governa tudo", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Se o bloqueio fosse um Appointment de paciente nulo herdaria o maquin\u00e1rio autom\u00e1tico (WhatsApp para n\u00famero inexistente + varredura para NO_SHOW, corrompendo a m\u00e9trica de faltas). Al\u00e9m disso Appointment.patientId \u00e9 FK obrigat\u00f3ria. Invariante duro TB.2: scheduler.ts NUNCA referencia TimeBlock. Mesmo princ\u00edpio do ExternalEvent."}, {"id": "_context_features_time_blocks_soft_block", "label": "Bloqueio \u00e9 SUAVE (avisa, n\u00e3o impede)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".context/features/time-blocks.md", "source_location": "Bloqueio \u00e9 SUAVE", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Modal 'Hor\u00e1rio bloqueado \u2014 quer agendar mesmo assim?'; a detec\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 client-side sobre os bloqueios j\u00e1 carregados na janela vis\u00edvel (o backend n\u00e3o mostra modal)."}, {"id": "_context_features_time_blocks_overlapping_block_for", "label": "overlappingBlockFor + blockedConfirm (AlertDialog controlado)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/time-blocks.md", "source_location": "Integra\u00e7\u00e3o na agenda", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Usa <Button> puros (n\u00e3o AlertDialogAction/Cancel) para N\u00c3O fechar via Radix \u2014 s\u00f3 setBlockedConfirm(null) fecha, e ESC/backdrop conta como 'Voltar'. onDismiss reverte invalidando ['appointments'] para o card voltar ao lugar. Guard scheduleChanged evita reabrir o aviso ao editar s\u00f3 observa\u00e7\u00f5es."}, {"id": "_context_features_time_blocks_mirror", "label": "syncTimeBlockCreate/Update/Delete (espelho sem convidados)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".context/features/time-blocks.md", "source_location": "Regras de neg\u00f3cio \u2192 Espelho no Google", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reusa as primitivas da Fase C com id determin\u00edstico e tag origem-app (nunca reaparece no overlay). Evento sem attendees (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 paciente); DELETE l\u00ea o googleEventId ANTES do hard-delete. N\u00c3O validado E2E com credencial Google real."}, {"id": "_context_features_time_blocks_model", "label": "model TimeBlock (fora de AUDITED_MODELS)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".context/features/time-blocks.md", "source_location": "Modelo TimeBlock", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dado operacional do pr\u00f3prio tenant, sem PII de terceiros. Dura\u00e7\u00e3o at\u00e9 1440 min (f\u00e9rias/feriado); title default 'Bloqueado'. GET com data malformada devolve 400 (guard isNaN), n\u00e3o 500."}], "edges": [{"source": "_context_features_time_blocks_feature", "target": "_context_features_time_blocks_separate_table_firewall", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".context/features/time-blocks.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_context_features_time_blocks_separate_table_firewall", "target": "_context_featu